## Validation Annotations

```java
// String validations
@NotEmpty                    // Not null and not empty
@NotBlank                    // Not null, not empty, not whitespace
@Size(min = 1, max = 80)     // Length constraints
@Email                       // Email format

// Number validations
@NotNull                     // Not null (any type)
@Digits(fraction = 0, integer = 10)  // Phone numbers
@Min(0) @Max(100)            // Range

// Date validations
@Past                        // Must be in the past
@Future                      // Must be in the future
@PastOrPresent              // Past or current date
```

