## Fetch Type Guidelines

| Use Case | Fetch Type | Reason |
|----------|------------|--------|
| Small, always needed collection | `EAGER` | Avoid lazy loading issues |
| Large or optional collection | `LAZY` | Performance optimization |
| Single entity reference | `LAZY` (default) | Load on demand |

