## JSON Serialization

```java
// Hide internal methods from JSON
@JsonIgnore
protected Set<Pet> getPetsInternal() { ... }

@JsonIgnore
public boolean isNew() { ... }

// For circular reference prevention
@JsonIgnore
private Owner owner;  // On child side if needed
```

---

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Use `List<>` for @OneToMany | Use `Set<>` (prevents duplicates) |
| Forget `mappedBy` on inverse side | Always specify `mappedBy` |
| Expose internal collections | Return unmodifiable views |
| Skip validation annotations | Add appropriate validation |
| Use field injection in entities | Entities don't use DI |
| Forget `@Column(name=...)` | Always map to snake_case column |
